  <h2>Etiquette tips</h2>
  <ul>
    <li><b>Dress modestly,</b> especially at religious sites and in traditional neighbourhoods.</li>
    <li><b>Be discreet</b> about eating and drinking in public during daylight.</li>
    <li><b>Say “Ramadan Kareem”</b> — locals appreciate the greeting.</li>
    <li><b>Accept iftar invitations</b> if offered; it’s a generous tradition.</li>
  </ul>
</Guide>
